{"version":1,"content":"<p>前TVB咪神白雲早前大方認愛比自己年輕16歲的外籍小鮮肉男友，兩人熱戀期愛得高調。</p><p>近日，白雲與男友展開甜蜜歐遊，隨後更飛往度假勝地毛里裘斯，展開一場親近大自然奢華之旅。</p><p>在毛里裘斯期間，白雲不僅體驗了「與獅同行」的刺激行程，還深潛入海與鯨魚共</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.760734+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T06:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"fc849e4783137aafedaedec8c251a50aa283f8dd539a68edef834988b433ec4e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}